%% D12 Factory Version state machine
%% Type: state · Page: /architecture/factory-versioning, /specification/v1/factory-version
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Draft: assembling
  Draft --> Candidate: composition frozen, digest computed
  Candidate --> Qualified: Qualification Record PASS for scope
  Candidate --> Rejected: Qualification FAIL (preserved)
  Qualified --> Active: Decision (promotion) per environment
  Active --> Restricted: regression — scope narrowed
  Restricted --> Active: re-qualified for full scope
  Active --> Suspended: incident containment
  Restricted --> Suspended
  Suspended --> Active: Decision (restoration) + current Qualification Record
  Active --> Deprecated: successor Active
  Restricted --> Deprecated
  Qualified --> Deprecated: never activated, superseded
  Deprecated --> Retired: no routed work, grants revoked, records retained
  Rejected --> [*]
  Retired --> [*]
  classDef control fill:#e4e9ec,stroke:#4a5d68,color:#171a18
  classDef trust fill:#dcefe4,stroke:#1a654b,color:#171a18
  classDef execution fill:#f5e6d0,stroke:#9a4f1c,color:#171a18
  classDef neutral fill:#faf9f5,stroke:#59605a,color:#171a18
  classDef warn fill:#f5e6d0,stroke:#b3261e,color:#171a18
  class Draft,Candidate execution
  class Qualified,Active trust
  class Restricted,Suspended warn
  class Rejected,Deprecated,Retired neutral
